#: ../../../programming_guides/python_compatibility.md:1
msgid "Python Compatibility"
msgstr "Python 兼容性"

#: ../../../programming_guides/python_compatibility.md:3
msgid ""
"TileLang is a Python-embedded DSL, but not all Python syntax is supported "
"inside TileLang DSL. This guide clarifies what works, what doesn't, and how "
"to translate common Python patterns into TileLang equivalents. Specially, we "
"focus on the kernel part (scripts inside `with T.Kernel`) semantics. For "
"host-side semantics when using eager-style JIT, please stay tuned for our "
"upcoming documentation."
msgstr ""
"TileLang 是一种 Python 嵌入式 DSL，但并非所有 Python 语法都在 TileLang DSL "
"内部受支持。本指南阐明了哪些语法可用、哪些不可用，以及如何将常见的 Python "
"模式转换为 TileLang 等效形式。特别地，我们重点关注内核部分（即 `with T.Kernel` "
"内部的脚本）的语义。关于使用 eager 风格 JIT 时的主机端语义，请关注我们即将"
"发布的文档。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/python_compatibility.md:9
msgid "The following codes use the conventional aliases:"
msgstr "以下代码使用约定的别名："

#: ../../../programming_guides/python_compatibility.md:11
msgid ""
"import tilelang\n"
"import tilelang.language as T\n"
"from tilelang import jit\n"
msgstr ""
"import tilelang\n"
"import tilelang.language as T\n"
"from tilelang import jit\n"

