#: ../../../programming_guides/python_compatibility.md:47
msgid "Functions & Classes"
msgstr "函数与类"

#: ../../../programming_guides/python_compatibility.md:49
msgid ""
"As a kernel script language, TileLang doesn't support functions or classes. "
"You can use `@T.macro` to define reusable code blocks, which will be inlined "
"at compile time like `__device__` function."
msgstr ""
"作为一种内核脚本语言，TileLang 不支持函数或类。"
"你可以使用 `@T.macro` 来定义可重用的代码块，这些代码块将在编译时"
"像 `__device__` 函数一样被内联。"

